    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNestled on the outskirts of Mallow Town, this beautifully restored one-bedroom thatched cottage is a rare opportunity to own a piece of Ireland's rich architectural heritage. Lovingly maintained and sympathetically restored, the property seamlessly blends traditional charm with comfortable modern living, creating a truly unique home.\n\nBehind its iconic whitewashed walls and beautifully crafted thatched roof lies a warm and inviting interior, where original character features have been carefully preserved. The traditional open hearth forms the heart of the home, evoking the timeless charm of country living while providing a cosy focal point.\n\nExternally, the property enjoys generous front and rear gardens, offering excellent outdoor space and significant potential for future extension or expansion, subject to the necessary planning permission. A substantial block-built shed provides excellent storage and offers exciting potential for conversion into a home office, studio, hobby room, or garden retreat.\n\nThis charming cottage will appeal to a wide range of buyers, including first-time purchasers, those looking to downsize, or anyone seeking a peaceful home full of character within easy reach of all local amenities.\n\nIdeally situated within walking distance of Mallow Town Centre, the property benefits from convenient access to an excellent range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, sporting facilities, and public transport, while still enjoying the tranquillity and charm of its picturesque setting.\n\nMore than just a home, this exceptional cottage represents a treasured piece of Mallow's heritage—a beautifully preserved slice of Ireland's past, thoughtfully restored and ready to be enjoyed by its next owners."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving Room - 4.51m x 6.46m\nLaminate Flooring. Recessed Lighting. Feature stone fireplace with solid fuel stove insert. Door to rear garden.\n\nKitchen - 4.5m x 4.6m\nLaminate Flooring. Recessed Lighting. Fully Fitted kitchen with integrated hob & oven. Feature island with sink.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 4.5m x 3.37m\nLaminate Flooring. Recessed Lighting. Sliding Robes.\n\nEn-Suite - 1.8m x 4.32m\nTiled Flooring, Recessed Lighting. Whb with vanity, Double walk in shower and Toilet.\n\nBlock Built Shed/Garden Room - 3.42m x 5m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Stunning Thatch cottage</li><li>Large landscaped garden</li><li>Shed/Garden Room with electricity</li><li>Within walking distance of Mallow town</li><li>Fully Alarmed</li><li>Gas Fired central heating</li><li>All mains services</li><li>Turn-key condition</ul>"
      },
